==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|sorely}}, from {{inh|en|ang|sārlīċ|pos=adjective}}, {{m|ang|sārlīċe|pos=adverb}}; equivalent to {{suffix|en|sore|ly|id2=adverbial}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|sôrʹlē|a=GenAm}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈsɔɹli/}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsɔːli/|a=RP}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-sorely.wav|a=Southern England}}
* {{enPR|sōrʹlē|a=rhotic,non-horse-hoarse}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈso(ː)ɹli/}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsoəli/|a=non-rhotic,non-horse-hoarse}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɔː(ɹ)li}}

